stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Proposed
  Proposed --> Curated: provenance + task + expected outcome
  Curated --> Reviewed: domain and security review
  Reviewed --> Versioned: immutable ID + digest + datasheet
  Versioned --> Dev
  Versioned --> Validation
  Versioned --> SealedTest
  Dev --> Quarantined: ambiguity / defect / leakage
  Validation --> Quarantined: grader defect / duplicate / drift
  SealedTest --> Exposed: explicit controlled run
  Exposed --> Retired: compromised or saturated
  Versioned --> Superseded: new immutable version
  Quarantined --> Proposed: corrected as new case/version
